Package: oocat
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign syntax-highlighting file viewer and pager
 A bat/cat replacement written in pure openOODA, featuring
 negative-trust capability security, syntax highlighting via oote themes,
 line numbering, range windowing, and an MCP stdio surface.
